OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a cloudy day with
OL,6,Fshowers or longer spells of rain,
OL,7,Fheavy at times. Strong northwesterly
OL,8,Fwinds developing, reaching close to
OL,9,Fgale force along the North Coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA cloudy and breezy evening
OL,12,Fwith outbreaks of rain, some heavy at
OL,13,Ffirst. Clear spells overnight with
OL,14,Fshowers mostly easing, but some will
OL,15,Fcontinue to feed into the North coast.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FThere will be variable
OL,18,Famounts of cloud with bright spells
OL,19,Fand scattered showers. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
